<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>6-Month Full Stack Data Science & Gen AI Hub</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS for modern layout -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <!-- Lucide Icons for high-fidelity visuals -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; }
        .gradient-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #0f172a 100%); }
        .glass-card { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-800 antialiased">

    <!-- TOP HEADER / HERO BANNER -->
    <header class="gradient-bg text-white py-10 px-6 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#fff_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:16px_16px]"></div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-6 relative z-10">
            <div>
                <span class="bg-blue-500/30 text-blue-300 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest border border-blue-400/20">6-Month Masterclass Journey</span>
                <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-2 tracking-tight">Full Stack Data Science <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-teal-300">with Gen AI & Agents</span></h1>
                <p class="text-slate-300 mt-2 text-sm md:text-base flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="user" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400"></i> Mentor: Mr. Omkar &bull; <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400"></i> Daily @ 9:00 AM IST
                </p>
            </div>
            <!-- Admin Fast Contact -->
            <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 text-center md:text-right w-full md:w-auto">
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 uppercase font-semibold tracking-wider">Course Inquiries & Admin</p>
                <p class="text-lg font-bold text-teal-300 mt-0.5">Janaki Admin</p>
                <a href="https://wa.me/919133343371" target="_blank" class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all shadow-md transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                    <i data-lucide="message-square" class="w-4 h-4"></i> WhatsApp Chat Only
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN APP WRAPPER -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
        
        <!-- LEFT PANEL: NAVIGATION & PROGRESS TRACKING -->
        <aside class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
            
            <!-- OVERALL 6-MONTH PROGRESS ARCHETYPE -->
            <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <i data-lucide="trending-up" class="text-blue-600"></i> 6-Month Roadmap Tracker
                </h3>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">
                            <span>Overall Course Completion</span>
                            <span id="overall-progress-text" class="font-bold text-blue-600">5%</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-slate-200 rounded-full h-2.5">
                            <div id="overall-progress-bar" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 5%"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Interactive Timeline Modules Toggle -->
                <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center text-xs">
                    <div class="p-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 font-semibold rounded-lg border border-blue-100">M1-M2:<br>Core Foundations</div>
                    <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 opacity-60">M3-M4:<br>ML & Deep Learning</div>
                    <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 opacity-60">M5-M6:<br>GenAI & Agent Frameworks</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- SEARCH & SYSTEM UTILITIES -->
            <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm space-y-4">
                <div class="relative">
                    <i data-lucide="search" class="absolute left-3 top-3.5 text-slate-400 w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <input type="text" id="search-input" oninput="filterDays()" placeholder="Search daily topics or keywords..." class="w-full pl-9 pr-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-all">
                </div>
                
                <!-- FREE CLOUD SYSTEM TOOLS (PORTABILITY) -->
                <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs">
                    <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium flex items-center gap-1"><i data-lucide="database" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-500"></i> 100% Free Backup:</span>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <button onclick="exportData()" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-100 font-medium text-slate-700">Export</button>
                        <button onclick="document.getElementById('import-file').click()" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-100 font-medium text-slate-700">Import</button>
                        <input type="file" id="import-file" class="hidden" onchange="importData(event)">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CLASS TIMELINE SELECTOR LIST -->
            <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="calendar" class="text-blue-600"></i> Daily Class Directory
                    </h3>
                    <span id="day-counter" class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-bold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">10 Days</span>
                </div>

                <div id="days-list-container" class="space-y-2 max-h-[480px] overflow-y-auto pr-2">
                    <!-- Javascript populates days lists here -->
                </div>

                <!-- TRIGGER ADMIN MODAL BUTTON -->
                <button onclick="openAdminModal()" class="w-full mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-bold py-3 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md transform active:scale-95 cursor-pointer">
                    <i data-lucide="plus-circle" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Automation: Add Next Day Class
                </button>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- RIGHT PANEL: DYNAMIC COURSE CONTENT DISPLAY WORKSPACE -->
        <section class="lg:col-span-8">
            <div id="active-class-workspace" class="space-y-6">
                <!-- Dynamically populated from JS state management based on selection -->
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- AUTOMATION ADMIN MODAL (ADD NEW DAY RECONCILIATION) -->
    <div id="admin-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="bg-white w-full max-w-lg rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 transform transition-all animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="cpu" class="text-blue-600"></i> Course AI Administrator Portal
                </h3>
                <button onclick="closeAdminModal()" class="p-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600"><i data-lucide="x"></i></button>
            </div>
            
            <form id="add-day-form" onsubmit="handleAddNewDay(event)" class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mb-1">Class Day Number</label>
                    <input type="number" id="form-day-num" required placeholder="e.g. 11" class="w-full px-3 py-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mb-1">Core Technical Topic Title</label>
                    <input type="text" id="form-day-title" required placeholder="e.g. Python Functions and Global Scope" class="w-full px-3 py-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mb-1">YouTube Recording Link</label>
                    <input type="url" id="form-day-link" required placeholder="e.g. https://youtu.be/..." class="w-full px-3 py-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mb-1">Short Description for Kids/Grandparents</label>
                    <textarea id="form-day-desc" rows="2" required placeholder="Explain simply what this topic does..." class="w-full px-3 py-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none"></textarea>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-blue-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-blue-100 text-[11px] text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>💡 Automation Note:</strong> Saving this automatically injects the class metadata, setups dynamic generation presets for practice exercises, and configures review benchmarks into your local remote dashboard state instantly without computing cost.
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-3 pt-2">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeAdminModal()" class="w-1/2 py-2.5 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold rounded-xl text-sm transition-all">Cancel</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="w-1/2 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl text-sm transition-all shadow-md">Deploy Day Content</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

